  :adr/decision-summary "{:pattern \"two changes: (1) marketdata.feed adds live fetch+parse connectors for the 3 free/official R0 catalog sources, each returning data already shaped as a :quote/ingest request that still goes through the full MarketDataGovernor; (2) kotoba.securities.pricing is a new, entirely optional namespace in kotoba-lang/securities that queries cloud-itonami-isic-6311's real OperationActor via :disclosure/query for a governed reference price\", :repo-1 \"cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-6311\", :repo-2 \"kotoba-lang/securities\", :feed-sources [{:id :ecb-fx :url \"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/eurofxref/eurofxref-daily.xml\" :api-key-required false :verified-live true :note \"actually fetched and ingested through the real OperationActor this session via clojure -M:feed:dev:run-feed -- resulted in a :commit and updated the seeded fx-100 quote to the live-computed USD/JPY cross rate\"} {:id :us-eia-open-data :url \"https://api.eia.gov/v2/petroleum/pri/spt/data/\" :api-key-required true :verified-live false :note \"no EIA_API_KEY available in this sandbox -- fetch-eia-spot is implemented and unit-tested against a fixture matching EIA v2's documented public response schema, but not live-verified; marketdata.feed-demo reports SKIPPED honestly rather than faking success\"} {:id :fred-case-shiller-hpi :url \"https://api.stlouisfed.org/fred/series/observations\" :api-key-required true :verified-live false :note \"same as EIA -- no FRED_API_KEY available, implemented + fixture-tested, not live-verified\"}], :zero-dep-discipline \"http-kit/jsonista live only in deps.edn's :test/:feed aliases, never :deps -- same seam as langchain.jvm's org.httpkit.client/jsonista.core reference impl; cross-rate and the *-ingest-request shaping fns use plain double arithmetic (not BigDecimal/with-precision, which ClojureScript lacks) to stay genuinely portable .cljc, same choice marketdata.policy's tolerance-gate already made\", :credential-handling \"marketdata.feed never reads EIA_API_KEY/FRED_API_KEY from env itself -- the caller (new marketdata.feed-demo, plain .clj since it has no portable content) reads env and passes the key in explicitly as a plain string argument, same injected-credential discipline as scripts/b2-creds.cljs\", :inherited-fix \"a concurrent session fixed cloud-itonami-isic-6311's default-phase fail-open bug (3 -> 1, same shape found and fixed this session in the shared talent.phase template and its many kotoba-lang/etzhayyim siblings) and landed it directly on main (PR #1) while this work was in progress; verified byte-identical to this session's own independent fix of the same bug before discarding the local duplicate commit and rebasing onto the landed one\", :test-results-isic-6311 \"clojure -M:dev:test: 46 tests / 177 assertions, 0 failures (was 32/137 before this ADR). clojure -M:lint: 0 errors, 0 warnings\", :securities-pricing-namespace \"kotoba.securities.pricing/reference-price queries a compiled cloud-itonami-isic-6311 OperationActor via :disclosure/query under a subscriber context (same MarketDataGovernor-checked op any other subscriber sends -- active tenant/tier contract required, halted/circuit-broken instrument escalates to a human) and returns the governed price or nil (never a fabricated fallback); position-with-market-price is a convenience wrapping kotoba.securities/position\", :securities-dependency-isolation \"kotoba.securities/export/ui have zero compile-time or runtime dependency on kotoba.securities.pricing or cloud-itonami-isic-6311 -- a deployment that never requires kotoba.securities.pricing runs exactly as before, offline, same isolation shape as cloud-itonami-isic-6910's formation.corporate-intel -> cloud-itonami-isic-8291 cross-reference. deps.edn adds the dependency to top-level :deps (not alias-gated), mirroring that precedent directly rather than inventing a new alias-gating pattern -- a :local/root classpath entry is not itself network/IO\", :test-results-securities \"clojure -M:test: 19 tests / 37 assertions, 0 failures (was 24 assertions before this ADR). clojure -M:lint: 0 errors, 0 warnings\", :landing-protocol \"cloud-itonami-isic-6311 is standalone plain-git (not west-registered) -- committed and pushed directly to main after syncing. kotoba-lang/securities IS a shared west-managed repo -- per root CLAUDE.md protocol, edited in an isolated git worktree outside the superproject root (with symlinked sibling deps to satisfy :local/root resolution), pushed to a feature branch, landed via a server-side gh api .../merges (never touching the shared orgs/kotoba-lang/securities checkout directly), then the worktree/branch cleaned up and the shared checkout fast-forwarded read-only\", :manifest-registration \"only kotoba-lang/industry's registry (unchanged by this ADR) and manifest/west.yml's securities entry pin advanced (--entry securities, minimal diff, fast-forward 13728ffeab51 -> 86317e4abbb4). cloud-itonami-isic-6311 remains unregistered in manifest/repos.edn per the existing cloud-itonami-{ISIC} blueprint convention\"}"
  :adr/authoritative true
